sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite(s): n/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Configuration State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Memory State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Reusable State: N/a

    CSMS->>CS: ClearChargingProfileRequest (chargingProfilePurpose = TxDefaultProfile, evseId = <Configured evseId>, stackLevel = <Configured stackLevel>)
    Note over CSMS: Validation: Message ClearChargingProfileRequest<br>- chargingProfileCriteria.chargingProfilePurpose TxDefaultProfile AND<br>- chargingProfileCriteria.stackLevel <Configured stackLevel> AND<br>- chargingProfileCriteria.evseId <Configured evseId> AND<br>- chargingProfileId must be omitted

    CS-->>CSMS: ClearChargingProfileResponse (status = Accepted)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Post scenario validations: N/a
